{{!-- Map layout: which way the nose points. One click here is the single fact the module cannot
      guess from a vehicle's artwork, and seating, the engine region and the cover ray all read it.
      Rendered by BOTH vehicle layouts, next to the Footprint field; the option list (icon, label,
      which one is lit) is assembled in the sheet's _prepareContext. --}}
<div class="field cp-veh-layout" title="{{CPLocal 'Vehicle.FrontTip'}}">
    <label>{{CPLocal "Vehicle.FrontLabel"}}</label>
    <span class="flexrow flex-pad cp-veh-front">
        {{#each layout.frontOptions}}
        <button type="button" class="cp-veh-front-btn{{#if active}} cp-active{{/if}}"
                data-action="layoutFront" data-front="{{key}}"
                title="{{label}}" aria-label="{{label}}"><i class="{{icon}}"></i></button>
        {{/each}}
    </span>
</div>
{{!-- What this vehicle stops when someone shoots THROUGH it (Core p.99). Both fields are left
      EMPTY when the book prefill for the vehicle's type is in force — the placeholder shows the
      number actually in play — so an untouched sheet never freezes a prefill into stored data.
      Open frames prefill 0 and say so; typing a number over that is how an unusual one opts in. --}}
<div class="field" title="{{CPLocal 'Vehicle.CoverBodySpTip'}}">
    <label>{{CPLocal "Vehicle.CoverBodySpLabel"}}</label>
    <span class="flexrow flex-pad">
        <input type="number" name="system.layout.bodySp" value="{{layout.bodySpStored}}"
               placeholder="{{layout.bodySp}}" min="0" step="1">
    </span>
</div>
<div class="field" title="{{CPLocal 'Vehicle.CoverEngineSpTip'}}">
    <label>{{CPLocal "Vehicle.CoverEngineSpLabel"}}</label>
    <span class="flexrow flex-pad">
        <input type="number" name="system.layout.engineSp" value="{{layout.engineSpStored}}"
               placeholder="{{layout.engineSp}}" min="0" step="1">
    </span>
</div>
{{#unless layout.providesCover}}
<div class="field span-two-cells">
    <label class="cp-veh-nocover" title="{{CPLocal 'Vehicle.CoverNoneTip'}}">{{CPLocal "Vehicle.CoverNoneLabel"}}</label>
</div>
{{/unless}}
